      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "You have my thanks!\r\nMight I ask of you to investigate the Volden\r\nMines Large Tunnels?",
        "Jp" : "やぁ、ありがたい！\r\n《ボルド大坑道》の様子見、お願いできますか"
