      "MsgSerial" : 286188,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Arisen, I would ask that you\r\nconfirm the existence of such a troublesome\r\nbeast once and for all.",
        "Jp" : "覚者さんにはずばり、再開発の妨げに\r\nなりそうな巨人の有無を見て来て頂きたい\r\nわけです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286189,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Fell the giant should it exist!\r\nDefeating the likes of a cyclops would come\r\nnatural to an Arisen of your prowess.",
        "Jp" : "で、居た場合は討伐の方もぜひ！\r\nサイクロプスくらい、あなたほどの覚者さんなら\r\n退治したことはおありでしょう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286190,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Also, while the rubble blocking\r\nthe entrance has been cleared, there's\r\nlike to be weak rock formations inside.",
        "Jp" : "そうそう、入り口のガレキは撤去しましたが\r\n坑道内部はまだ崩落しているかもしれません"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286191,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
