      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "―Also, I've often heard that a \r\ncyclops lurks the tunnels. That sort of strength\r\nmight also work just as well!",
        "Jp" : "――しかし、サイクロプスが坑道に入り込んだ\r\nって話はよく聞きますが、岩盤崩落とは\r\nそこまでの力があるんですかねぇ――？"
      },
